## Analysis of Current cargo2nix vs rust-flake Implementation

### 1. Current State in flake.nix

From examining the current `flake.nix` file, I can see:

**Current cargo2nix setup:**
```nix
inputs = {
  nixpkgs.url = "github:NixOS/nixpkgs/nixos-unstable";
  flake-parts.url = "github:hercules-ci/flake-parts";

  # TODO: Move away from these to https://github.com/juspay/rust-flake
  cargo2nix.url = "github:cargo2nix/cargo2nix/release-0.11.0";
  rust-overlay.url = "github:oxalica/rust-overlay";

  process-compose-flake.url = "github:Platonic-Systems/process-compose-flake";
